          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764792278066_1",
              "name": "wave_nbr",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.SET_INITIAL_VARIABLES.$input.WaveNumber}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result_count\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n    \"page_count\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n    \"page_nbr\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n    \"next_page\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n    \"previous_page\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n    \"results\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"status_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"description\": \"Status of the Allocation\"\n          },\n          \"container_nbr\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Container Number\"\n          },\n          \"lpn_type_id__code\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"LPN Type code\"\n          },\n          \"lpn_type_id__description\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"LPN Type description\"\n          },\n          \"cntr_inv__to_from_inv__type_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"description\": \"Allocation type\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"status_id\",\n          \"container_nbr\",\n          \"lpn_type_id__code\",\n          \"cntr_inv__to_from_inv__type_id\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result_count\",\n    \"page_count\",\n    \"page_nbr\",\n    \"next_page\",\n    \"previous_page\",\n    \"results\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set Initial Variables"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764791975091"
          },
          "code": "SET_INITIAL_VARIABLES",
          "id": "1764844908895",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764844925153",
              "name": "WaveNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.INITIAL_INPUT.$output.WaveNumber}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GETOBLPNTYPE"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764883649968"
          },
          "code": "GETOBLPNTYPE",
          "id": "1764868537423",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764868537424_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert on wave functionality. Using the output of  GetWaveOBLPN business object {{$context.$nodes.GETWAVEOBLPN.$output}} , extract and summarize outbound LPNs created by a wave for a warehouse supervisor. Input (source) \n* GetWaveOBLPN: outbound LPN records created by the wave, including container status, weight, volume, and lpn_type_id\n\nTask / calculation\nCount total OBLPN records in GetWaveOBLPN (total LPNs created by the wave)\nCount total  Full LPN allocation (this means not cubed) : {{$context.$nodes.GETWAVEOBLPN.$output.results[0].cntr_inv__to_from_inv__type_id==3}} \nGroup records by lpn_type_id, excluding null/empty values (populated lpn_type_id indicates the LPN has been cubed)\nFor each distinct lpn_type_id, return the count of OBLPNs\nConstraints/notes\nTreat null/empty lpn_type_id as not cubed and exclude from per-type breakdown\nif {{$context.$nodes.GETWAVEOBLPN.$output}} is empty, this means that no OBLPNs/ Outbound LPNs created. Treat an empty input as \"no OBLPNs created\""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"total_oblpn_count\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"description\": \"Total count of OBLPN records in GetWaveOBLPN\"\n    },\n    \"total  Full LPN\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"description\": \"Total count of OBLPN records in GetWaveOBLPN\"\n    },\n    \"oblpn_by_lpn_type\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"description\": \"Counts of OBLPNs grouped by non-null/empty lpn_type_id__code\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"total_oblpn_count\",\n    \"oblpn_by_lpn_type\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_OTHER_WMS26ABO",
            "functionName": "getWaveStats",
            "name": "GetWaveStats"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764884685601"
          },
          "code": "GETWAVESTATS",
          "id": "1764883649968",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764883676336_1",
              "name": "pWaveNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$variables.WaveNumber}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/GetWaveStats/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result_count\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"page_count\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"page_nbr\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"next_page\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"null\",\n        \"string\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"previous_page\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"null\",\n        \"string\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"results\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"id\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"wave_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"id\": {\n                \"type\": \"integer\",\n                \"description\": \"Internal Wave ID identifier.\"\n              },\n              \"key\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Wave Number\"\n              },\n              \"url\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"id\",\n              \"key\",\n              \"url\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"nbr_oblpns_created\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"description\": \"Number of OBLPNs created.\"\n          },\n          \"cubing_time\": {\n            \"type\": [\n              \"string\",\n              \"null\"\n            ],\n            \"description\": \"timestamp indicating time it took during the cubing process.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"id\",\n          \"wave_id\",\n          \"nbr_oblpns_created\",\n          \"cubing_time\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result_count\",\n    \"page_count\",\n    \"page_nbr\",\n    \"next_page\",\n    \"previous_page\",\n    \"results\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "SummaryOBLPNs"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARYOBLPNS",
          "id": "1764884685601",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764884685603_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Agent Objective:\nIdentify the type and status of outbound LPNs (OBLPNs) generated by a wave process, specifically if they were cubed or not. Generate a summary report with relevant breakdowns.\n\nData Sources:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_Wave.$output}}\n{{$context.$nodes.GETWAVESTATS.$output}}\n{{$context.$nodes.GETOBLPNTYPE.$output}}\n\nif on summary refering to cubing_time mention as cubing time\n\nLogical Rules:\n\n1. Identify Non-Cubed (\"Full LPN\") OBLPNs:\nIf all records have \"cntr_inv__to_from_inv__type_id\": 3, cubing did NOT occur.\nThese should be labeled as \"Full LPN Type\".\n\n2. Cubing Configured but No Allocations Matched:\nIf {{$context.$nodes.GETWAVESTATS.$output.results[0].cubing_time}} > 0 AND {{$context.$nodes.GET_Wave.$output.results[0].cubing_rule_id}} is not null:\nCubing was attempted (rule was set), but no allocations matched the selection criteria.\nCubing Did Occur:\nIf {{$context.$nodes.GETOBLPNTYPE.$output.oblpn_by_lpn_type}} contains values, cubing did occur.\nOutput Requirements:\n\nGenerate an easy-to-read summary including:\n\nSummary Instructions\n\n1. Total OBLPNs Created:\nReport the total number of OBLPNs created by the wave.\n\n2. Full LPN Type OBLPNs:\nIf the total number of ‘Full LPN’ type OBLPNs is greater than zero, include this count. Do not mention this section if the value is null or zero.\n\n3. Breakdown by LPN Type:\nList the count of OBLPNs for each LPN type description. Do not include any LPN type with a blank or empty description.\n\n4. Special Notice:\nIf all the following conditions are true:\n\nThe number of 'Full LPN' OBLPNs is greater than zero,\nCubing time is greater than zero, and\nA cubing rule was selected (as described above),\nthen include the message:\n“A cubing rule was configured on the wave template but the selection criteria did not match any allocations generated by the wave.”\nDo not mention if cubing did take place.\n\n5. No OBLPNs Condition:\nIf no OBLPNs were created, provide only this information.\n\nFormatting Guidelines:\nDo not include the word \"summary\" or any key-value pair labels in the response.\nAlways present the summary in clear, plain text (not as JSON, code, or bracketed key-value formats).\nClearly mention the wave ID at the start of the response.\nUse professional, concise sentences.\nFor example, if no OBLPNs were created, output:\nWave: <WAVE_ID>\nNo outbound LPNs (OBLPNs) were created by this wave."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"summary\"]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
